+### ASR
+
+| Trigger | Structured error/current result | Current payload/retryability | Safe recovery requirement/evidence |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| Wrong stage input | `ASRStageError.invalidPayload`; suspend | nil, false | Internal invariant violation; no provider retry, no stale preview/copy. `ASRStage.swift:30`. |
+| Empty recording | `.emptyCapture` → notice `未录到音频，请重试` | no recovery context | New recording; never submit or finalize already-started realtime based on preview. `ASRStage.swift:58`; cleanup installed before preflight `:40`. |
+| Clearly silent recording | `.clearlySilent` → notice `未检测到声音，请重试` | no recovery context | New recording, no fallback/preview promotion, downstream polish/delivery/history. `ASRStage.swift:58`. |
+| NaN/±infinity/outside [-1,1] sample, unsupported sample rate decision | `ASRStageError.invalidAudio`; suspend | nil, false | Rerecord; retrying identical PCM cannot repair it. Never reinterpret as transient ASR. `ASRStage.swift:61`; analyzer scans entire recording, including malformed tail `SpeechPreflight.swift:45`, `:51`, `:59`. |
+| Too short / detector unavailable / noncancellation detector error | continue original ASR chain; detector error becomes indeterminate unavailable | original samples unchanged | Detector uncertainty is not a recognition failure or evidence of silence. `ASRStage.swift:49`, `:55`, `:64`. |
+| Shared completion budget already expired after preflight | generic `ASRStageError.transcriptionFailed("识别超时，请重试")`; suspend | nil, true; saved input remains audio at execution boundary | Explicit same-recording ASR retry is valid with renewed budget; no automatic retry or preview promotion. `ASRStage.swift:66`. |
+| Provider absent after route capture (`providerForID`/lease nil) | `SpeechProviderError.notAvailable` thrown | caught as firstFailure; then generic failure, nil, true | Engine/readiness repair or reroute; distinguish from transient transport. Capture route may be stale by execution. `ASRStage.swift:125`, `:138`, `:171`. |
+| Route candidate IDs empty | no provider called; generic `transcriptionFailed("语音识别未就绪，请配置云端 API Key 或加载本地模型")`; suspend | nil, true | No engine is a settings/readiness issue. Empty constrained route can mean selected policy has no engine even when another engine exists; offer auto routing only under that policy. `ASRStage.swift:80`, `:170`; `ASRRouter.swift:24`; readiness tests `SelfTest.swift:1323`. |
+| Provider returns empty/whitespace final text | `ASRStageError.transcriptionFailed("未识别到完整文字，请重试")` | goes through same catch/fallback; final generic, nil, true | Explicit ASR retry possible with valid retained PCM; cannot promote expired/invalid/silent previews. `ASRStage.swift:129`. |
+| Any provider failure, another captured-route candidate succeeds | health failure for failed candidate, success for winner; continue transcript | winner text; context stores rawTranscript, provider, usedFallback, coarse reason | Preserve current one-winner chain and complete audio; config/auth errors may fall back to another allowed provider without repeating the failed provider. `ASRStage.swift:86`, `:138`, `:149`. |
+| All providers fail, first is realtime local configuration error | original `RealtimeASRConfigurationError` survives terminal result | nil, true | Existing type survives but Boolean is wrong for unchanged config. Use ASR settings repair; no immediate repeat of same invalid config. `ASRStage.swift:171`. |
+| All providers fail, first is any other provider/model/network/HTTP error | typed firstFailure is discarded; generic ASR error | nil, true | Preserve safe typed kind before wrapping; distinguish cases in provider table below. `ASRStage.swift:142`, `:171`. |
+| All fail while budget remains, preview nonempty | continue transcript(preview) | preview becomes text payload; rawTranscript is not assigned in this branch | Existing fallback behavior outside M3's silence/invalid/expired guards. Classification must not broaden preview promotion into those prohibited paths. Changes to this fallback are separate product scope. `ASRStage.swift:162`. |
+| Task/context canceled or provider throws CancellationError | `CancellationError` suspend helper, nil, false; owned execution can suppress to complete | no available recovery actions | No second provider/health/transcript commit after cancel; defer cleans live attempt. `ASRStage.swift:35`, `:139`, `:177`; wrapper `PipelineStage.swift:80`. |
+
+ASR's saved realtime helper deliberately starts a fresh handle and sends original PCM sequentially in ≤1600-sample chunks, checking cancellation between effects (`ASRStage.swift:182`). Failed live handles are consumed and canceled, not reused. Classification must never treat a canceled/closed old handle as reusable infrastructure.
+
+### PostProcess, Polish, Injection
+
+| Stage/trigger | Current result/error | Payload/retryability | Safe M4 handling |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| PostProcess wrong input | suspend `PostProcessStageError.invalidPayload` | nil, false | Internal/invariant category; no stale text. `PostProcessStage.swift:20`. |
+| PostProcess empty after fallback | suspend `PostProcessStageError.emptyResult` | rawText original transcript, false | Copy only actual available nonempty text; no unchanged retry or delivery of empty output. `PostProcessStage.swift:35`, `:40`. |
+| Polish wrong input | suspend `PolishStageError.invalidPayload` | nil, false | Internal category. `PolishStage.swift:95`. |
+| Polish disabled | continue polished(processed unless empty, otherwise raw) | preserves raw provenance | No failure. `PolishStage.swift:100`, `:107`; fallback helper `:4`. |
+| Polish provider missing | mark polishFailed; continue complete fallback | processed preferred, raw last resort | Optional enhancement failure must not block text delivery; no retry card merely because LLM is unconfigured. `PolishStage.swift:111`. |
+| Polish deadline, transport/API/decode/stream-completeness error | mark polishFailed + destination-neutral notice; continue complete fallback | never partial streamed draft | Keep current degrade behavior. Authentication/config classification can support diagnostics but should not suspend successful ASR text. `PolishStage.swift:120`, `:148`, `:167`. |
+| Polish completed result empty or changes protected literals | throw `PolishStageError.damagedLiterals`, then continue complete fallback + literal-preservation notice | full processed text retained | Treat as rejected enhancement, not transient ASR, not prompt to accept damaged output. Empty completion shares this type today. `PolishStage.swift:142`, `:157`. |
+| Polish cancellation | suspend CancellationError | rawText raw transcript, false | No delivery fallback after cancel; action mapper must suppress even nonempty rawText. `PolishStage.swift:101`, `:149`. |
+| Injection wrong input | suspend `InjectionStageError.invalidPayload` | nil, false | Internal category. `InjectionStage.swift:50`. |
+| Injection missing AX / changed, secure, blind/nontext target | policy chooses clipboard; copy then complete clipboard outcome | final text safely copied, notice | Degradation/safe delivery outcome, not failed injection retry. `InjectionStage.swift:74`, `:82`. |
+| Paste cannot snapshot all formats or cannot dispatch, no permitted automatic typing fallback | suspend `InjectionStageError.clipboardSnapshotIncomplete` or `.pasteNotDispatched` | rawText is complete **final** text, false | Copy result + dismiss; preserve clipboard until explicit copy. These must never acquire retry-input. `InjectionStage.swift:105`, `:129`. |
+| Automatic mode paste failed before first event, same fresh trusted editable target | one typing fallback, revalidates before every event | same final text; reserved delivery attempt retained | Preserve M3 guarded fallback only; failure classifier must not add another attempt. `InjectionStage.swift:106`, `:112`, `:117`. |
+| Typing failure before first event in paste-protected fallback | suspend underlying InjectionError | final text, false | Explicit copy result + dismiss; original clipboard protected. `InjectionStage.swift:164`. |
+| Typing failure before first event in normal typing mode | normally copy once and complete clipboard; CancellationError is not copied | complete final text | Preserve safe clipboard fallback, no automatic repeated typing. `InjectionStage.swift:161`, `:170`. |
+| Any paste/typing failure/cancel **after an actual event** | complete uncertain; completion notice says sent but insertion unconfirmed | recovery via stored full final text/history, no retry card | No automatic or explicit resend of uncertain delivery. Classify using event evidence, not merely Error or cancellation type. `InjectionStage.swift:97`, `:135`, `:156`, `:184`. |
+| Paste clipboard changes after preparation/event | complete uncertain; ownership-change notice | no copy override | Do not overwrite user clipboard or resend. `InjectionStage.swift:100`. |
+| Cancellation before event | canceled outcome; stage may suspend CancellationError; owned wrapper suppresses stale result | no copy/retry actions | Temporary clipboard write alone is an effect, not an event; do not label it uncertain. `InjectionStage.swift:135`; M3 evidence below. |
+
+`rawText` is semantically overloaded: PostProcess/Polish use original ASR text while Injection uses complete final result. Action text/payload must preserve that distinction; a generic “copy raw” label is incorrect for Injection (`SelfTest.swift:590`).
